5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm Yumi. Let's figure out who the werewolf is together.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hi... I'm Daisuke. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my best.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Asuka here. I prefer logic over emotion. Let's proceed efficiently.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, hello dear! I'm Shizue. It's lovely to meet you all.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hi, I'm Midori. I hope we can find the truth peacefully.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, you seem very serious. Do you have any initial suspicions?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know yet. I'm just listening for now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I am observing. Silence is often more telling than noise.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Asuka. Let's listen carefully to everyone's words.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I think we should share our thoughts openly to build trust.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"That's a good point, Midori. I feel like Daisuke is being very quiet.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm sorry... I'm just not good at talking in groups.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Quietness is not guilt. Do not jump to conclusions, Yumi.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"Yes, Daisuke, please don't worry. We are all friends here.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I agree with Asuka. Let's give Daisuke some space.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Okay, I'll be careful. I hope we can find the werewolf soon.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you... I'll try to speak up more.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Good. Let's end the day. The night will reveal some truths.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Goodnight, everyone. Sleep well and stay safe.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,Goodnight. I'll be thinking about what we discussed.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
