31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I have a strong feeling about Asuka. She seems too calm.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know. I'm still confused about everyone.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Yumi, your intuition is weak. I am simply logical.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, Yumi, are you sure? Asuka seems very reasonable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm a bit worried about Yumi's accusation. Let's be careful.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm sure. Asuka, why are you so defensive?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
