39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,Asuka has a point. We shouldn't vote based on feelings alone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. Let's listen to Daisuke's concerns.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
